      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but im not really able to call the doctor right now since im at work all day. its just the standard daytime nyquil with the dextromethorphan in it... i checked the box and it seems pretty standard. can u just tell me if that specific combo is generally considered safe or if i should be worried? i really need to sleep tonight.",
